WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Welcome to Build an Evidence Portfolio. I’m Brian

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.360
Kennedy Jr. Your education, work and entrepreneurship can

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.000
produce evidence of what you can do. This

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.240
course helps you make that evidence clear and

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.707
truthful. We will choose one capability, identify a

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.720
sample that supports it, ask for useful feedback

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.960
and show how the work changed. You will

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:24.240
also practice explaining your contribution without taking credit

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.800
for someone else’s work or claiming results you

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.680
did not measure. A practice project can count

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.480
when it is labeled honestly. Your portfolio can

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.360
remain private, and you can use text, audio

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.240
or another accessible format. By the end, you

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.800
will have one complete entry with an artifact,

00:00:40.853 --> 00:00:44.240
a revision and a clear explanation. Start with

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:46.320
one audience you want to help understand your

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:49.120
work. Then choose the capability you want that

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.640
person to be able to see.
